* Data converters (project-authored, simplified).
* bench_d_adc8 vc gn vin ref clk d0..d7: 8-bit sampling ADC. On every rising edge of clk the code floor(256*(vin-gn)/(ref-gn)), limited to 0..255,
*   is registered into eight d_dff and drives the d outputs (logic levels follow vc-gn). The quantiser is a behavioural source; each bit is read through an adc_bridge.
* bench_d_dac8 d0..d7 ref out gn: 8-bit R-2R ladder DAC. Each bit switches its 2R leg to ref (input above VTH above gn) or to gn; out is the
*   ladder's open end, so out = (ref-gn) * code / 256 + gn unloaded, with output resistance R. RSW is the on resistance of every leg switch.
.subckt bench_d_adc8 vc gn vin ref clk d0 d1 d2 d3 d4 d5 d6 d7 params: LO=0.45 HI=0.55 RK=1 AK=0 VOLF=0 VOHF=1 ROUT=45 TPD=50n TD=1n
Xck vc gn clk dck bench_din LO={LO} HI={HI} RK={RK} AK={AK} TD={TD}
Rvin vin gn 1g
Rref ref gn 1g
Bcod cod 0 V=min(max(floor(256*(V(vin)-V(gn))/max(V(ref)-V(gn),1m)),0),255)+0.5
Rcod cod 0 1g
.model adc adc_bridge(in_low=0.5 in_high=0.5 rise_delay={TD} fall_delay={TD})
.model ff d_dff(clk_delay={TPD} rise_delay={TD} fall_delay={TD})
Bb0 b0 0 V=floor(V(cod)/1)-2*floor(V(cod)/2)
Rb0 b0 0 1g
Ab0 [b0] [db0] adc
Af0 db0 dck NULL NULL dq0 NULL ff
Xo0 vc gn dq0 d0 bench_dout VOLF={VOLF} VOHF={VOHF} ROUT={ROUT} TD={TD}
Bb1 b1 0 V=floor(V(cod)/2)-2*floor(V(cod)/4)
Rb1 b1 0 1g
Ab1 [b1] [db1] adc
Af1 db1 dck NULL NULL dq1 NULL ff
Xo1 vc gn dq1 d1 bench_dout VOLF={VOLF} VOHF={VOHF} ROUT={ROUT} TD={TD}
Bb2 b2 0 V=floor(V(cod)/4)-2*floor(V(cod)/8)
Rb2 b2 0 1g
Ab2 [b2] [db2] adc
Af2 db2 dck NULL NULL dq2 NULL ff
Xo2 vc gn dq2 d2 bench_dout VOLF={VOLF} VOHF={VOHF} ROUT={ROUT} TD={TD}
Bb3 b3 0 V=floor(V(cod)/8)-2*floor(V(cod)/16)
Rb3 b3 0 1g
Ab3 [b3] [db3] adc
Af3 db3 dck NULL NULL dq3 NULL ff
Xo3 vc gn dq3 d3 bench_dout VOLF={VOLF} VOHF={VOHF} ROUT={ROUT} TD={TD}
Bb4 b4 0 V=floor(V(cod)/16)-2*floor(V(cod)/32)
Rb4 b4 0 1g
Ab4 [b4] [db4] adc
Af4 db4 dck NULL NULL dq4 NULL ff
Xo4 vc gn dq4 d4 bench_dout VOLF={VOLF} VOHF={VOHF} ROUT={ROUT} TD={TD}
Bb5 b5 0 V=floor(V(cod)/32)-2*floor(V(cod)/64)
Rb5 b5 0 1g
Ab5 [b5] [db5] adc
Af5 db5 dck NULL NULL dq5 NULL ff
Xo5 vc gn dq5 d5 bench_dout VOLF={VOLF} VOHF={VOHF} ROUT={ROUT} TD={TD}
Bb6 b6 0 V=floor(V(cod)/64)-2*floor(V(cod)/128)
Rb6 b6 0 1g
Ab6 [b6] [db6] adc
Af6 db6 dck NULL NULL dq6 NULL ff
Xo6 vc gn dq6 d6 bench_dout VOLF={VOLF} VOHF={VOHF} ROUT={ROUT} TD={TD}
Bb7 b7 0 V=floor(V(cod)/128)-2*floor(V(cod)/256)
Rb7 b7 0 1g
Ab7 [b7] [db7] adc
Af7 db7 dck NULL NULL dq7 NULL ff
Xo7 vc gn dq7 d7 bench_dout VOLF={VOLF} VOHF={VOHF} ROUT={ROUT} TD={TD}
.ends bench_d_adc8
.subckt bench_d_dac8 d0 d1 d2 d3 d4 d5 d6 d7 ref out gn params: R=10k VTH=2.5 RSW=1m
.model swh SW(VT={VTH} VH=0.05 RON={RSW} ROFF=1g)
.model swl SW(VT={-VTH} VH=0.05 RON={RSW} ROFF=1g)
Rt n0 gn {2*R}
Rl0 n0 x0 {2*R}
Sh0 ref x0 d0 gn swh
Sl0 x0 gn gn d0 swl
Rd0 d0 gn 1g
Rs0 n0 n1 {R}
Rl1 n1 x1 {2*R}
Sh1 ref x1 d1 gn swh
Sl1 x1 gn gn d1 swl
Rd1 d1 gn 1g
Rs1 n1 n2 {R}
Rl2 n2 x2 {2*R}
Sh2 ref x2 d2 gn swh
Sl2 x2 gn gn d2 swl
Rd2 d2 gn 1g
Rs2 n2 n3 {R}
Rl3 n3 x3 {2*R}
Sh3 ref x3 d3 gn swh
Sl3 x3 gn gn d3 swl
Rd3 d3 gn 1g
Rs3 n3 n4 {R}
Rl4 n4 x4 {2*R}
Sh4 ref x4 d4 gn swh
Sl4 x4 gn gn d4 swl
Rd4 d4 gn 1g
Rs4 n4 n5 {R}
Rl5 n5 x5 {2*R}
Sh5 ref x5 d5 gn swh
Sl5 x5 gn gn d5 swl
Rd5 d5 gn 1g
Rs5 n5 n6 {R}
Rl6 n6 x6 {2*R}
Sh6 ref x6 d6 gn swh
Sl6 x6 gn gn d6 swl
Rd6 d6 gn 1g
Rs6 n6 out {R}
Rl7 out x7 {2*R}
Sh7 ref x7 d7 gn swh
Sl7 x7 gn gn d7 swl
Rd7 d7 gn 1g
Rref ref gn 1g
.ends bench_d_dac8
